NLBSE 2027 Skill Classification local repository candidate

Existing project source is distributed with its existing Apache License 2.0.
New local portability adapters, contract tests and documentation are identified
by the source-change ledger; original rights and notices are retained.

The official NLBSE 2027 baseline is copied under upstream/skill-classification,
commit f265cd60c73f78a0a2282ae625876fd2dc4a0e1b. It is owned by its original
contributors and retains its Apache-2.0 LICENSE. Its wrapper documents preserved
historical SkillScope behavior and unresolved evaluation issues.

Pretrained models and the dataset are separate assets, not covered merely by this
repository's source-code license. Qwen model cards and the dataset card declare
Apache-2.0. Microsoft CodeBERT repository code carries the included MIT notice;
the pinned Hugging Face weights card does not itself state a license. See
docs/licensing.md and docs/reproduction_gaps.json for redistribution gates.

The paper remains attributed to Xin Xu and Jun Yu, University of Science and
Technology of China. No publisher copyright transfer or paper relicensing is
implied by the source repository LICENSE.

This is a local candidate. No public release, external submission or official
competition qualification is claimed.

Nov.8 private hosting adds no public redistribution clearance. The original license/ownership statements and scope limitations remain.
